  "categories": "Restaurants, Tacos, Mexican, Event Planning & Services, Food, Food Trucks, Caterers",
  "city": "Santa Barbara",
  "hours": null,
  "name": "Blue Corn Tacos Catering",
  "review_info": [
    {
      "review_date": "2021-08-23 01:18:56",
      "review_stars": 5.0,
      "review_text": "Paulo and Vannia are master-caterers and their unique blue corn tacos and secret-blends salsas  gave our family reunion the kick we were all cravingThey are true pros and just the best!  look no further for the perfect caterers for your next party.  We stand by this message!  Pastor Eddie & Alice Perez Santa Barbara CA"
    },
    {
      "review_date": "2021-07-28 21:35:42",
      "review_stars": 5.0,
      "review_text": "We had Blue Corn Tacos cater my sister's bachelorette of 20 people - our expectations were exceeded! Vannia and Paulo were kind, professional, and excellent cooks. Everyone was raving about their salsas, and how incredible the tacos were! If you're hosting an event in SB - look no further, these two are the best."
    },
    {
      "review_date": "2021-06-27 17:34:34",
      "review_stars": 5.0,
      "review_text": "Great food and wonderful people!! Paulo and Vannia did a fantastic job at my birthday party!! The food was delicious and everyone loved it!! They worked with us in planning the menu and were so flexible. The best part is how nice they both were! Lovely people! I highly recommend this business!!"
    }
  ],
  "state": "CA"
}

