      "review_date": "2018-06-24 13:46:20",
      "review_stars": 1.0,
      "review_text": "I have to assume that the \"Sandwich Artist\" who made my meal had to be none other than Hannah H\u00f6ch, because this was clearly a dadaesque attack on the logic of how to make a meatball sub!"
    },
    {
      "review_date": "2017-06-15 20:12:30",
      "review_stars": 4.0,
      "review_text": "Standard subway experience except they did not take our gift card/voucher with a bar code and the amount on it. The cashier did not put any effort and we ended up paying using credit card. Whole wheat bread was a little dry but nothing much to complain about."
    },
    {
      "review_date": "2017-06-11 21:25:19",
      "review_stars": 3.0,
      "review_text": "Good  chicken breast sandwich and courteous help but only one employee and I waited 25 min to order.  Probably not going back to this location."
    }
  ],
